  "title": "Tradeweb Exchange-Traded Funds Update – July 2026",
  "summary": "Trading activity on the Tradeweb European-listed ETF marketplace reached EUR 77.5 billion in July, an increase of approximately 29% year-over-year. Transactions completed via Tradeweb’s Automated Intelligent Execution (AiEX) tool represented a record 96% of tickets and accounted for 32% of notional volume on the platform.",
